                <pb facs="0178" n="144" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg144"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Appendix B.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Form of consent given to a Frenchman
                        to change his allegiance</hi>.</p>
                <p>[Translation.]</p>
                <p>Ministry of Justice: The President of the French Republic on the report of the
                    keeper of the seals, minister, decrees: <list>
                        <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Art. I.</hi> M _______ _______, born on
                            ____, at ____, residing at _____, is authorized to become a naturalized
                            American.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Art. II.</hi> The keeper of the seals,
                            minister of justice, is charged with the execution of this decree, which
                            will be published in the Bulletin of Laws.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Done at <placeName>Paris</placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1897-08-02">the
                    _____</date>.</dateline><lb/>(Signed) (Name of President.)<lb/>(Signed) (Name of
                        Minister.)<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Keeper of the Seals, Minister of
                        Justice.</hi></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>For exemplification.</p>
                    <p>The Councillor of State, Director of Civil Affairs and of the Seal:</p>
                    <closer>(Signature.)</closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
